{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0125DUGsi64JAJxQFyWNCovB","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"iPhone 18 Pro release date\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date: Apple’s New Flagship Could Arrive In September 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.brut.media/in/articles/iphone-18-pro-release-date-apple-s-new-flagship-could-arrive-in-september-2026\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro release date: when to expect Apple's next-gen Pro powerhouses\",\"url\":\"https://www.phonearena.com/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date_id180977\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro release date: When Apple is expected to reveal its new lineup\",\"url\":\"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/business/tech/iphone-18-pro-ultra-foldable-release-date-uae\"},{\"title\":\"iphone 18 release date when apples ne\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-ne\"},{\"title\":\"9to5mac.com\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/18/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-model-is-coming/\"},{\"title\":\"9to5mac.com\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/?p=1048598\"},{\"title\":\"9to5mac.com\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/17/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-flagship-is-coming/\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: Release Date and Pre-Orders - MacRumors\",\"url\":\"https://www.macrumors.com/2026/09/10/iphone-18-pro-release-date-and-preorders/\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date & What to Expect\",\"url\":\"https://smartish.com/blogs/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date\"}]\n\nApple's announced schedule for the iPhone 18 Pro is available. A MacRumors article reports that Apple has announced that the iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max will be available to pre-order starting Saturday, September 12. Its release day is Friday, September 18, with availability in 20 other countries starting Friday, September 25.\n\nEarlier articles from before the event were forecasts. They predicted a September 9 announcement and a September 18 or 25 release. They also said the standard iPhone 18 would come later, with the regular iPhone 18, iPhone 18e and possibly a second-generation iPhone Air arriving in spring 2027.\n\nSummary: The iPhone 18 Pro's official release date is September 18, 2026, with pre-orders from September 12. Some countries get it on September 25. The MacRumors piece is the most recent source I found and is the only one that reports an Apple announcement rather than a prediction. I did not check Apple's own site, so you may want to confirm there.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2ab4789-5c2d-4fbd-bbee-6cd48df278af","uuid":"0be8a4c2-1280-46d4-b442-08d708cc76f5","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:34:33.180Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"iPhone 18 Pro release date","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01BTcgLEPtNhPp5UF21S7rA3","content":[{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro Release Date: Apple’s New Flagship Could Arrive In September 2026","url":"https://www.brut.media/in/articles/iphone-18-pro-release-date-apple-s-new-flagship-could-arrive-in-september-2026"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro release date: when to expect Apple's next-gen Pro powerhouses","url":"https://www.phonearena.com/news/iphone-18-pro-release-date_id180977"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro release date: When Apple is expected to reveal its new lineup","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/business/tech/iphone-18-pro-ultra-foldable-release-date-uae"},{"title":"iphone 18 release date when apples ne","url":"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/21/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-ne"},{"title":"9to5mac.com","url":"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/18/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-model-is-coming/"},{"title":"9to5mac.com","url":"https://9to5mac.com/?p=1048598"},{"title":"9to5mac.com","url":"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/17/iphone-18-release-date-when-apples-new-flagship-is-coming/"},{"title":"iPhone 18 Pro: Release Date and Pre-Orders - MacRumors"